scopeTarget ​与​ Scoped：​事件​的​作用域​过滤​ <p>​事件​系统​按​ <code>this</code>（​接收器​）​过滤​ listener。<code>scopeTarget(base, key)</code> ​造​一个​只​带路​由​状态​的​对象​，​保留​ base ​原有​的​ Cordis filter，​再​叠加​ scope ​谓词​：</p> <pre><code>export function scopeTarget&lt;T extends object&gt;(base: T, key: ScopeKey | undefined): Scoped&lt;T&gt; {
  const baseFilter = (base as { [CordisContext.filter]?: (ctx: Context) =&gt; boolean })[CordisContext.filter]
  const carrier = {
    [CordisContext.filter](ctx: Context): boolean {
      if (baseFilter !== undefined &amp;&amp; !baseFilter.call(base, ctx)) return false
      const tag = scopeOf(ctx)
      if (tag === undefined) return true
      for (let cursor = key; cursor !== undefined; cursor = scopeParents.get(cursor)) {
        if (cursor === tag) return true
      }
      return false
    },
  }
  carrierKeys.set(carrier, key)
  return carrier as unknown as Scoped&lt;T&gt;
}
</code></pre> <p>​判定​规则​：</p>    listener ​的​注册​上下文​ ​派发​ key ​是否​收到​     ​未​打​ tag（​全局​ ctx ​注册​） ​任意​ ​收到​   ​打​了​ tag，tag == key ​或​ key ​的​祖先​ key ​收到​   ​打​了​ tag，tag ​在​ key ​之下​ key ​不​收​（​事件​只​向​上流​，​不​向下​）   ​任意​ <code>key === undefined</code>（​无​ scope ​主体​） ​只收​未​打​ tag ​的​    <p><code>Scoped&lt;T&gt;</code> ​是​编译​期​品牌​：scope ​过滤​事件​的​声明​把​ <code>this</code> ​类型​写成​ <code>Scoped&lt;Agent&gt;</code>，​拿​着​裸​ service ​派发​会​编译​失败​；​载体​本身​不​暴露​ subject ​属性​，​真实​主体​始终​走​事件​参数​。<code>carrierKeys</code> ​这个​ WeakMap ​让​ <code>isScopeCarrier</code> / <code>carrierKeyOf</code> ​能​回读​路由​ key。</p>

